  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div><ix:continuation id="F_ce07172b-701a-4ae9-9360-7e75ea74e53e_3" continuedAt="F_ce07172b-701a-4ae9-9360-7e75ea74e53e_4"><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_de57714e-043e-4b17-8eba-009dbd591b3b_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">expensed as incurred. The Company records depreciation using the straight-line method over the following estimated useful lives:</span></p><p style="text-indent:5.413%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_830b63bd-dc1a-4f88-8fe3-1e08cce9abfb" contextRef="C_38d9f0a7-b8c2-4403-b024-d8bc4a68dc66" name="ncmi:ScheduleOfUsefulLivesTableTextBlock" escape="true">
