       </table><p style="padding-bottom:1pt;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;border-bottom:0.011pt solid;margin-right:73.333%;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.463%;display:flex;margin-top:6pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.525603731872177%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(1)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The additions to the Company's intangible assets during 2025 are due to (1) $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_114b153a-98d7-4a48-9331-8cb16c77817a" contextRef="C_54186ec4-a319-4ae9-82f5-d1c0ef9f1b3e" name="us-gaap:FinitelivedIntangibleAssetsAcquired1" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million in intangible assets recognized in conjunction with the purchase of Spotlight in the fourth quarter of 2025 as discussed further within Note 5&#8212;Business Combinations, (2) $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_8a5c588d-3742-4ba7-98c1-bd793e2f1199" contextRef="C_564e5435-e5ba-4141-829c-f0c989039d5d" name="us-gaap:FinitelivedIntangibleAssetsAcquired1" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million related to the acquisition of datasets and (3) $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c727c322-8872-4254-b7d6-0c92fadf4c61" contextRef="C_0aa585ea-df04-4886-b11f-a1415472f84f" name="us-gaap:FinitelivedIntangibleAssetsAcquired1" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million related to costs incurred to extend the useful life of the Company's intangible asset related to the ESA Parties by </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_11f0410f-c3f5-4485-90bb-0b243becd79b" contextRef="C_0aa585ea-df04-4886-b11f-a1415472f84f" name="ncmi:IntangibleAssetsPeriodOfExtension" format="ixt-sec:duryear"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">5</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> years through the 2025 AMC Agreement.</span></div></div></ix:nonNumeric></div></ix:continuation></div></div>
